! Oracle anchor, v1.21.0.  BASIS SERIES: the same method and the
! same molecule in five different basis sets.
!
! HF is chosen deliberately.  With no exchange-correlation grid in
! play, any disagreement can only come from the basis itself --
! contraction coefficients, normalisation, the Cartesian/spherical
! convention, the shell ordering.  A DFT functional would blur
! exactly the thing this series is meant to isolate.
!
! No internal cross-check can do this: StudDFT agrees with its own
! basis library by construction.
!
! Basis: aug-cc-pVTZ
%method  HF
%basis   aug-cc-pVTZ
%job     energy
%charge  0
%mult    1
%spherical
%scf_etol 1e-10
%scf_ptol 1e-8
%scf_diis_etol 1e-7
%geom angstrom
H  0. 0. 0.
F  0. 0. 0.92
*end
